    indonesian: Barang
  - key: inventory.type.document
    english: Document
    indonesian: Dokumen
  - key: inventory.full
    english: Inventory is full. Free a slot first.
    indonesian: Inventory penuh. Kosongkan satu slot terlebih dahulu.
  - key: inventory.cannot_use_yet
    english: This item cannot be used here yet.
    indonesian: Barang ini belum bisa digunakan di sini.
  - key: inventory.drop_failed
    english: This item could not be dropped.
    indonesian: Barang ini belum bisa dibuang.
  - key: inventory.required_item_missing
    english: You do not have the required item.
    indonesian: Kamu belum memiliki barang yang dibutuhkan.
  - key: inventory.wrong_item
    english: This item does not work here.
    indonesian: Barang ini tidak cocok untuk digunakan di sini.
  - key: inventory.unavailable
    english: Inventory is unavailable.
    indonesian: Inventory belum tersedia.
