    english: Pick up {0}
    indonesian: Ambil {0}
  - key: interact.item.use
    english: Use {0}
    indonesian: Gunakan {0}
  - key: quest.side.wrong_route
    english: Wrong Route
    indonesian: Salah Jalur
  - key: quest.side.wrong_route.talk
    english: Deliver the file to digitization
    indonesian: Antar berkas ke ruang digitalisasi
  - key: quest.optional.shared_meal
    english: Have a Meal with A and B
    indonesian: Makan Bersama A dan B
  - key: quest.optional.shared_meal.talk
    english: Sit with A and B before collecting the key
    indonesian: Duduk bersama A dan B sebelum mengambil kunci
  - key: quest.optional.desk_preparation
    english: Before You Leave
    indonesian: Sebelum Pergi
  - key: quest.optional.desk_preparation.finish
    english: Tidy the desk before leaving
    indonesian: Rapikan meja sebelum pergi
  - key: quest.optional.supplies
    english: Field Supplies
    indonesian: Perbekalan Lapangan
  - key: quest.optional.supplies.buy
    english: Buy the supplies you need
    indonesian: Beli perbekalan yang dibutuhkan
  - key: document.wanaseta_original.name
    english: "Wanaseta Archive \u2014 Original Document"
    indonesian: "Arsip Wanaseta \u2014 Dokumen Asli"
  - key: document.wanaseta_original.description
    english: Original archive carried in a protective case with its official handover
      record.
    indonesian: Arsip asli dibawa menggunakan kotak pelindung dan dokumen serah-terima
      resmi.
  - key: document.wanaseta_translation.name
    english: Wanaseta Archive Translation
    indonesian: Terjemahan Arsip Wanaseta
  - key: document.wanaseta_translation.description
    english: A travel account and warning by someone who claims to have stayed in
      the village.
    indonesian: Catatan perjalanan dan peringatan dari seseorang yang mengaku singgah
      di desa tersebut.
  - key: document.field_assignment.name
    english: Field Verification Assignment
    indonesian: Surat Tugas Verifikasi Lapangan
  - key: document.field_assignment.description
    english: Field verification assignment for MC, A, and B.
    indonesian: Tugas verifikasi lapangan untuk MC, A, dan B.
  - key: document.agenda_2026_08_24.name
    english: "Agenda \u2014 24 August 2026"
    indonesian: "Agenda \u2014 24 Agustus 2026"
  - key: document.agenda_2026_08_24.description
    english: A diary entry about the Wanaseta archive assignment.
    indonesian: Catatan agenda mengenai tugas verifikasi arsip Wanaseta.
  - key: document.travel_receipt.name
    english: Payment Receipt
    indonesian: Struk Pembayaran
  - key: document.travel_receipt.description
    english: Proof of supply expenses after the assignment.
    indonesian: Bukti pengeluaran perbekalan setelah penugasan.
  - key: interact.chapter.activity
    english: Interact
    indonesian: Berinteraksi
  - key: interact.chapter.shop
    english: Shop
    indonesian: Belanja
  - key: inventory.purchase_complete
    english: The item and receipt were added to inventory.
    indonesian: Barang dan struk masuk inventory.
  - key: quest.main.morning
    english: Morning Routine
    indonesian: Rutinitas Pagi
  - key: quest.main.morning.enter
    english: Enter the archive office
    indonesian: Masuk ke gedung ANRI
  - key: quest.main.morning.desk
    english: Go to your workstation
    indonesian: Menuju ruang kerja
  - key: quest.optional.breakfast
    english: Morning Breakfast
    indonesian: Sarapan Pagi
  - key: quest.optional.breakfast.eat
    english: Have breakfast before work
    indonesian: Sarapan sebelum bekerja
  - key: interact.chapter.bulletin
    english: Read the notice board
    indonesian: Baca papan pengumuman
  - key: story.quest.travel_spbu
    english: Travel to the fuel station with Raka and Sinta
    indonesian: Menuju SPBU bersama Raka dan Sinta
  - key: document.spbu_receipt.name
    english: "Fuel Station Receipt \u2014 Vehicle Fuel and Supplies"
    indonesian: "Struk SPBU \u2014 Pengisian dan Perbekalan Kendaraan"
  - key: document.spbu_receipt.description
    english: Receipt for filling the vehicle and buying and filling two reserve fuel
      containers.
    indonesian: Bukti pengisian tangki dan pembelian serta pengisian dua jerigen
      cadangan.
  - key: document.spbu_trip_photo.name
    english: "Travel Photo \u2014 Fuel Station Stop"
    indonesian: "Foto Perjalanan \u2014 Persinggahan SPBU"
  - key: document.spbu_trip_photo.description
    english: A photo of MC, A and B in the parking area with the fuel station sign
      behind them.
    indonesian: Foto MC, A dan B di area parkir, dengan papan SPBU di belakang mereka.
  - key: story.quest.spbu_return
    english: Return to the car with Raka and Sinta
    indonesian: Kembali ke mobil bersama Raka dan Sinta
  - key: story.quest.spbu_departure
    english: Leave for Giriawas with Raka and Sinta
    indonesian: Menuju Giriawas bersama Raka dan Sinta
